        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your speeding delivery package in this fast-paced 3D obstacle runner where precision and quick reflexes are your only lifeline. Your goal? Survive the  highway, avoid obstacles, and reach your final delivery destination at 25,000 meters.<br><br><strong>Speed-Based Challenge:</strong> The further you go, the faster it gets. Keep your focus sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Obstacles:</strong> Dodge walls and hazards that spawn in random patterns every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Pads:</strong> Boost and Slow Pads create moments of intensity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ramp Launches:</strong> Fly off ramps with cinematic flair—if you land it right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Mistake Death System:</strong> Crash once, and it's game over. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Score Tracking:</strong> Compete with yourself and reach new milestones with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D Aesthetic:</strong> Minimalist, modern visuals for a clean and vibrant atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause, Settings, and Mute Options:</strong> Built-in quality-of-life features to let you play on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first Unity Game. I learned a lot and had fun working on this project. <br><br>Special thanks to...<br>Brackeys  for making this possible.<br>Music: JUANJO_SOUND<br>SFX: Dustyroom, VoiceBosch, SoundBits, Olivier Giardot<br>UI: MadFireOn, Mr_Command_Coder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback and support from...<br>Bryan, Danny, Daniel, Dab <br><br> Look out for my next project! <br>Follow MindPlayPark</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your speeding delivery package in this fast-paced 3D obstacle runner where precision and quick reflexes are your only lifeline. Your goal? Survive the  highway, avoid obstacles, and reach your final delivery destination at 25,000 meters.<br><br><strong>Speed-Based Challenge:</strong> The further you go, the faster it gets. Keep your focus sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Obstacles:</strong> Dodge walls and hazards that spawn in random patterns every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Pads:</strong> Boost and Slow Pads create moments of intensity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ramp Launches:</strong> Fly off ramps with cinematic flair—if you land it right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Mistake Death System:</strong> Crash once, and it's game over. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Score Tracking:</strong> Compete with yourself and reach new milestones with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D Aesthetic:</strong> Minimalist, modern visuals for a clean and vibrant atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause, Settings, and Mute Options:</strong> Built-in quality-of-life features to let you play on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first Unity Game. I learned a lot and had fun working on this project. <br><br>Special thanks to...<br>Brackeys  for making this possible.<br>Music: JUANJO_SOUND<br>SFX: Dustyroom, VoiceBosch, SoundBits, Olivier Giardot<br>UI: MadFireOn, Mr_Command_Coder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feedback and support from...<br>Bryan, Danny, Daniel, Dab <br><br> Look out for my next project! <br>Follow MindPlayPark</p>",
